etch-mark smoothing therapy oil designed to nourish and support skin as the belly grows during pregnancy. It is one of HATCH's most popular beauty products. As with all stretch-mark products, results vary by individual, and it is formulated with pregnancy-safe, plant-derived ingredients.<\/p>"}},"question_MGydnF":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Which pregnancy-safe beauty products should I start with?","answer":"<p>HATCH's Mama Must-Haves Kit ($128) is an essential mama-safe starter lineup, bundling its core beauty products together. For a smaller entry point, the Belly Oil Mini-Me ($28) is a travel-sized dropper, and Nipple + Lip ($28) is a multipurpose rescue balm.<\/p>"}},"question_ngtUfT":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Can I return beauty products?","answer":"<p>HATCH accepts returns on beauty items only if they are unopened and in their original packaging. Once a beauty product has been opened it cannot be returned, unless defective, and this applies both online and in HATCH's stores. Beauty products should be stored out of direct light at cool or room temperature.<\/p>"}},"question_DWKUyi":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"question":"Is there anything for pregnancy swelling or tired legs?","answer":""}}},"block_order":["question_8Rcj4w","question_xpX7dW","question_miwjTU","question_MGydnF","question_ngtUfT","question_DWKUyi"],"name":"t:sections.faq.presets.faq.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"show_categories":false,"subheading":"","title":"Frequently Asked Questions","content":""}}},"order":["collection-banner","custom_collection_banner_DBnLPy","custom_main_collection_nNU4Kk","main","collection_description_Fcq86X","seo_block_A6jhrT","nosto_collection_prepend","nosto_collection_append","faq_GdnRaD"]}